text = "The movement of numbers on the playing field for four sides, does by swipe.

A very unusual version of the classic game 2048, in which the player will have to fight with himself, because the game throws stones on the field completely unexpectedly, which betrays some serious innovations, you definitely did not expect this, new sensations are guaranteed to you.

Rules.
When mixing from edge of field to edge, the same numbers are added to each other, the player's task is to score as many points as possible."

